---
name: Claude Code OCSF Demo Data
description: |
  Generates a live Claude Code demo feed normalized to OCSF, with the invented prompts,
  responses, and tool input of the recording.
  Requires the `anthropic` package.
---

demo::claude_code
where @name in ["otel.log", "otel.span"]
anthropic::claude_code::ocsf::normalize include_content=true
this = ocsf_cast(ocsf_derive(this))
